[{"id": 110983834, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 8, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 109960975, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p>In this picture, we have crossed off today (Wednesday 12th). If we count the circles and the star, we find out that there are three days left.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 110983987, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 9, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 109960975, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><strong>What if days are hard?</strong></p>\n<p>Sometimes, children find it hard to understand how many days are left. Looking at this countdown calendar will help, but sometimes talking about the number of \"sleeps\" can help. In our calendar, the arrows between the days represent the nights (\"sleeps\"), so you can count the arrows to see how many \"sleeps\" are left before your event!</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 110983010, "text": "Important things to include", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 110982969, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 210, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p style=\"text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Important things to include in your calendar:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">A space for each day between now and your chosen event, including today and the day of the event. You need to be able to count how many days are left until the event.</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">A way of crossing off each day (maybe you can use a pen to cross off the day, or you could stick a sticker on, or you could open a door like on an advent calendar).</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">A way for the adult to keep track of which day is which - we put days and dates in our example, just to make sure we didn't miss a day or accidentally do two on the same day.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 210, "name": "Countdown calendar", "logCreatedAt": "2023-05-03T11:16:29.965172", "logUpdatedAt": "2023-05-03T11:16:29.965172", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 109960975, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 210, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 110982376, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 109960975, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>What to do:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose an event you want to count down to. About ten days away is a good amount of time. It could be a birthday, family celebration, the school holidays, or anything you like!</li>\n<li>Make your countdown calendar! You can choose how you make it, or draw one on paper like in the photo above.</li>\n<li>Each day, cross off today on your calendar and see how many days are left until your event.</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 110983735, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 109960975, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>How many days left to go?</h2>\n<p>If you have crossed off today, count all the remaining days (including the day of your event) to find out how many days are left.</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImage